{"unit_id":"ntesicn__dsh-screenshot-xn#feature-1","repo":"ntesicn/dsh-screenshot-xn","commit":"1306fc3c3d5c5fb7d6682477f7aecc957831017f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 截图（xn）的功能「框选与标注」：用户从 DSH 输入框旁的截图入口打开面板，框选屏幕区域后可添加矩形、椭圆、箭头、画笔、马赛克或文字，再撤销重做并导出结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2039"]}
{"unit_id":"ntesicn__dsh-screenshot-xn#feature-2","repo":"ntesicn/dsh-screenshot-xn","commit":"1306fc3c3d5c5fb7d6682477f7aecc957831017f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 截图（xn）的功能「插入、复制和保存截图」：完成选区后，用户可将图片插入当前对话；若插入桥接不可用会尝试复制并提示手动粘贴，也可复制图片或通过保存对话框另存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3662"]}
{"unit_id":"ntesicn__dsh-screenshot-xn#feature-3","repo":"ntesicn/dsh-screenshot-xn","commit":"1306fc3c3d5c5fb7d6682477f7aecc957831017f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 截图（xn）的功能「截图文字识别」：用户可对选区发起 OCR，将识别出的文字作为可编辑结果展示；逻辑支持 Windows OCR 的语言标签归一化和结果整理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/ocr.mjs:1"]}
